            "review_text": "Ngọc Bảo Anh Đ\n11 contributions\n0\nGood price in Phu My Hung, District 7\nNov 2025 • Family\nThe restaurant was new, the atmosphere great, cozy place to talk with family and friend. The food was fantastic with the price, everything ok with me, best udon and miso soup in town, you should try this place.\nInsider tip:\nudon, tempura, salmon with some white fish was great. must try\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 11, 2025",
